    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit surface level for a thesis... could u go deeper into the liberal side? like what kind of theological or philosophical frameworks are they actually using to justify autonomy? it feels like they have a lot of complex reasoning behind it compared to just saying \"God says no.\"",
